WEBVTT

00:30:28.496 --> 00:30:32.788
where right now we have these systems that
have sort of enormous horsepower

00:30:32.788 --> 00:30:36.371
but no steering wheel. It's like, you know
, incredible capabilities,

00:30:36.371 --> 00:30:40.204
but no judgment. And there's like these
obvious ways in which today even

00:30:40.454 --> 00:30:45.204
a human plus three is far better
than either on their own.

00:30:45.913 --> 00:30:49.454
Many people speak about a world
where it's sort of A.I.

00:30:49.454 --> 00:30:52.829
as this external threat you speak about.

00:30:52.829 --> 00:30:56.496
At some point, we actually merge
with eyes in some way.

00:30:56.704 --> 00:30:57.871
What do you mean by that?

00:30:59.496 --> 00:31:03.538
There's a lot of different versions of
what I think is possible there, you know,